  "headline": "President Prabowo Subianto Names 19 New National Heroes Of Indonesia",
  "seoTitle": "Prabowo Names 19 New National Heroes",
  "metaDescription": "President Prabowo Subianto officially conferred the National Hero title upon 19 figures, including RM Margono Djojohadikusumo and Hoegeng Imam Santoso.",
  "aiSummaryBullets": [
    "President Prabowo Subianto officially awarded the title of National Hero to 19 selected figures.",
    "The list of recipients includes RM Margono Djojohadikusumo, Hoegeng Imam Santoso, Maraden Panggabean, and KH Wasyid.",
    "Minister of Culture Fadli Zon noted that the president initially expressed reluctance regarding the inclusion of his own grandfather."
  ],
  "aiContextParagraph": "The Indonesian government has officially designated 19 historical figures as National Heroes, a distinction awarded for their significant contributions to the nation. Among the recipients is RM Margono Djojohadikusumo, the grandfather of President Prabowo Subianto, who was recognized for his historical role in the national economy. Minister of Culture Fadli Zon revealed that the president had initially declined the nomination of his own family member to maintain impartiality during the selection process. Other notable figures receiving the honor include former National Police Chief Hoegeng Imam Santoso, former military commander Maraden Panggabean, and local historical figures like KH Wasyid from Banten. Regional officials have expressed hope that recognizing these diverse contributors will inspire younger generations, while government agencies are emphasizing the ongoing relevance of these individuals' legacies in modern national development efforts.",
